        <!-- STEP 4: 基礎交易型 -->
        <section id="step-4" class="step-section">
            <h2 class="h2-title">應用模式二：基礎交易型系統</h2>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="px-4 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg font-black text-sm">典型代表：PopIn, Outbrain, Taboola</div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="h3-title">一、簡述：非典型 RTB 的借鑑者</h3>
                <p class="detail-text mb-8">
                    許多聯播網（Ad Network）並不是真正的「交易所」，但它們借用了 OpenRTB 的通訊協定來擴充自己的買方生態。
                </p>

                <div class="diagram-container">
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-4 text-center uppercase tracking-widest">基礎交易型 (Network) 架構圖</h4>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 800 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full">
                        <rect x="20" y="80" width="100" height="80" rx="10" fill="white" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="2" />
                        <text x="70" y="125" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#475569">媒體網頁</text>
                        <!-- Ad Network -->
                        <rect x="300" y="40" width="200" height="160" rx="15" fill="#1e293b" />
                        <text x="400" y="90" text-anchor="middle" font-size="16" font-weight="900" fill="white">AD NETWORK</text>
                        <rect x="320" y="110" width="160" height="70" rx="8" fill="#334155" />
                        <text x="400" y="135" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8">內部出價引擎</text>
                        <text x="400" y="155" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" fill="#94a3b8">(自有預算優先)</text>
                        <!-- External DSP -->
                        <rect x="650" y="100" width="120" height="40" rx="5" fill="#64748b" />
                        <text x="710" y="125" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="white">外部 RTB DSP</text>
                        <!-- Lines -->
                        <path d="M 120 120 L 290 120" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
                        <path d="M 500 120 L 640 120" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-dasharray="8" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
                        <text x="570" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#E31C22" font-weight="bold">補底流量</text>
                    </svg>
                    <p class="text-center text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2">註：此模式中 OpenRTB 僅作為「溢出流量」或「外部填充」的接口</p>
                </div>

                <div class="theory-box border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/30">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3 uppercase">二、深度分析：為什麼它們用 OpenRTB？</h4>
                    <div class="detail-text space-y-4">
                        <p><strong>1. 擴充買方多樣性：</strong> 以 PopIn 為例，雖然主要透過自家的推薦引擎運算內容廣告，但為了提高「填補率 (Fill Rate)」，它們會將剩餘流量透過 OpenRTB 接口發送給外部 DSP（如 The Trade Desk）。</p>
                        <p><strong>2. 降低串接門檻：</strong> 對外部買方來說，PopIn 只要宣告自己支援 OpenRTB 2.5，買方就不需要額外開發，能直接使用現有的投標伺服器進行出價。</p>
                        <p><strong>3. 核心差異：</strong> ADX 通常是中立的，而基礎交易型聯播網通常擁有自己的預算池，OpenRTB 只是它們的「備援路徑」。</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ref-box">
                    <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark mr-2"></i> 參考文件與規範</h5>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://help.taboola.com/hc/en-us/articles/360003503114-Taboola-OpenRTB-Overview" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Taboola OpenRTB API Overview</a></li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://www.outbrain.com/help/advertisers/real-time-bidding/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Outbrain RTB for Advertisers Guide</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 5: 實戰物件模型 -->
        <section id="step-5" class="step-section">
            <h2 class="h2-title">實務開發：OpenRTB 2.5 物件全解析</h2>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <p class="mb-8 detail-text">
                    開發一個 DSP 或 SSP，你必須精確理解 JSON 中每一層級的意義。以下是經過實務開發總結的核心結構：
                </p>

                <h4 class="h3-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-red-500"></i> 1. 第一層級：BidRequest 根物件</h4>
                <div class="json-display">
                    {<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"id"</b>: <i>"unique_req_id_123"</i>, <span class="text-gray-500">// 追蹤拍賣的唯一辨識碼</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"at"</b>: 1, <span class="text-gray-500">// 拍賣類型 (1=一價, 2=二價)</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"tmax"</b>: 100, <span class="text-gray-500">// 逾時限制 (毫秒)</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"imp"</b>: [...], <span class="text-gray-500">// 曝光細節</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"site"</b>: {...}, <span class="text-gray-500">// 網頁資訊</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"device"</b>: {...}, <span class="text-gray-500">// 設備資訊</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"user"</b>: {...} <span class="text-gray-500">// 用戶標籤</span><br>
                    }
                </div>

                <h4 class="h3-title mt-12"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen text-blue-500"></i> 2. 設備物件 (Device) 的開發細節</h4>
                <div class="detail-text mb-6">
                    在行動端廣告中，<code>device</code> 物件是定價的關鍵。你必須從 HTTP Header 中解析出：
                </div>
                <div class="json-display">
                    <b>"device"</b>: {<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"ua"</b>: <i>"Mozilla/5.0..."</i>, <span class="text-gray-500">// 瀏覽器特徵</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"ip"</b>: <i>"123.123.123.123"</i>,<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"geo"</b>: { <b>"country"</b>: <i>"TWN"</i>, <b>"city"</b>: <i>"Taipei"</i> },<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"ifa"</b>: <i>"IDFA-FOR-IOS-OR-AAID-FOR-ANDROID"</i>, <span class="text-red-400">// 極重要：行動標識碼</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"os"</b>: <i>"iOS"</i>, <b>"osv"</b>: <i>"15.4"</i><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;}
                </div>

                <h4 class="h3-title mt-12"><i class="fa-solid fa-video text-green-500"></i> 3. 影音物件 (Video) 的深度細節</h4>
                <p class="detail-text mb-4">如果是影音廣告，<code>imp</code> 裡面會包含 <code>video</code> 物件：</p>
                <div class="json-display">
                    <b>"video"</b>: {<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"mimes"</b>: [<i>"video/mp4"</i>],<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"minduration"</b>: 5, <b>"maxduration"</b>: 30,<br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"protocols"</b>: [2, 3, 5, 6], <span class="text-gray-500">// 支援 VAST 2.0~4.0</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"linearity"</b>: 1, <span class="text-gray-500">// 線性(插播)或非線性</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;<b>"skip"</b>: 1 <span class="text-gray-500">// 是否允許跳過</span><br>
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;}
                </div>

                <div class="ref-box">
                    <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark mr-2"></i> 參考文件與規範</h5>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://iabtechlab.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/OpenRTB-API-Specification-Version-2-5-FINAL.pdf" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">OpenRTB 2.5 官方完整規格書 (PDF)</a></li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://iabtechlab.com/standards/adcom/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">AdCOM 1.0 (OpenRTB 3.0 的物件基礎)</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 6: 反欺詐 -->
        <section id="step-6" class="step-section">
            <h2 class="h2-title">實務開發：數位廣告的信任防線</h2>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="h3-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-shield text-red-500"></i> ads.txt 驗證邏輯</h3>
                        <div class="detail-text">
                            <p><strong>原理：</strong> 媒體在根目錄放置一個文本文件，內容如 <code>google.com, pub-12345, DIRECT, f08c47fec0942fa0</code>。</p>
                            <p><strong>開發實作：</strong> DSP 在收到 BidRequest 後，系統應查詢該 Site 物件的 domain。如果廣播過來的 Publisher ID 不在該網域的 ads.txt 清單中，系統必須直接捨棄出價。這能有效阻止 <strong>Domain Spoofing (網域偽造)</strong>。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="h3-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-link text-blue-500"></i> supply_chain (Schain)</h3>
                        <div class="detail-text">
                            <p><strong>原理：</strong> 追蹤流量經過了多少手轉發。</p>
                            <p><strong>深度分析：</strong> OpenRTB 2.5 擴充了 <code>schain</code> 物件. 如果你發現一筆流量經過了 5 個中介商才傳到你這裡，它的價格通常被灌水了，且來源不可信。買方通常會透過此欄位進行 <strong>SPO (供應鏈優化)</strong>。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ref-box">
                    <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark mr-2"></i> 參考文件與規範</h5>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://iabtechlab.com/ads-txt/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">IAB Tech Lab - Authorized Digital Sellers (ads.txt) 規範</a></li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/openrtb/blob/master/supplychainobject.md" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">SupplyChain Object 實作細節說明</a></li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://iabtechlab.com/sellers-json/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Sellers.json 規範 (對應 Schain 的賣方身分驗證)</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 7: 高效能串接 -->
        <section id="step-7" class="step-section">
            <h2 class="h2-title">實務開發：萬次 QPS 的系統架構</h2>
            <div class="glass-card">
                <h3 class="h3-title">一、極致的 QPS 處理能力</h3>
                <div class="detail-text mb-8">
                    在 OpenRTB 的世界，延遲就是金錢。如果你的伺服器響應超過 100ms，ADX 會直接斷開連接，你連「看」到流量的機會都沒有。
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-12">
                    <div class="border-b pb-8">
                        <h4 class="font-black text-xl mb-4 text-slate-800">1. 無狀態 (Stateless) 與分散式架構</h4>
                        <p class="detail-text">你的 Bidder (投標程序) 必須是無狀態的。透過 AWS 或 GCP 的負載平衡器將流量導流到數十台甚至數百台節點。所有的用戶數據 (User ID Mapping) 必須存在分散式快取如 <strong>Redis</strong> 中，而非資料庫。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border-b pb-8">
                        <h4 class="font-black text-xl mb-4 text-slate-800">2. JSON 的序列化陷阱</h4>
                        <p class="detail-text">在處理數萬次 QPS 時，傳統的 JSON 庫（如 Python 的預設 json）會消耗大量的 CPU。在 Java 開發中，通常會使用 <strong>Jackson</strong> 並進行預解析優化。</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="border-b pb-8">
                        <h4 class="font-black text-xl mb-4 text-slate-800">3. 宏替換 (Macro Replacement) 邏輯</h4>
                        <p class="detail-text">這是實作中最容易出錯的地方。你需要確保你的 <code>adm</code> (廣告代碼) 中包含了追蹤像素，且這些像素正確嵌入了價格宏。</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="ref-box">
                    <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark mr-2"></i> 參考文件與規範</h5>
                    <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://redislabs.com/solutions/use-cases/advertising-technology/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Redis for AdTech: 高效能 User Profile 存取架構</a></li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://github.com/google/openrtb" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Google OpenRTB Java/Protobuf Library (效能優化參考)</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- STEP 8: 即時模擬 -->
        <section id="step-8" class="step-section">
            <h2 class="h2-title">實務演練：高性能 RTB 競價模擬器</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
                <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
                    <div id="sim-status" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest">System Ready - Waiting for Broadcaster</div>
                    <div class="h-64 bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center border-4 border-slate-800 mb-8 overflow-hidden" id="ad-view">
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-slate-700 text-5xl mb-4 animate-pulse"></i>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 font-mono text-xs">AWAITING ADM RENDERING...</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="runSim()" id="sim-btn" class="w-full py-5 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-xl font-black shadow-xl hover:bg-red-700 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-satellite-dish"></i> 發起 OpenRTB 2.5 廣播
                    </button>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-around text-xs text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase">
                        <div id="qps-tag">Current QPS: 0</div>
                        <div id="latency-tag">Latency: 0ms</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                    <div class="flex justify-between px-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase">Incoming BidResponse</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-blue-500 font-bold">PROTO: JSON/HTTP</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="json-display h-[450px] overflow-auto shadow-inner" id="sim-res">
                        <span class="opacity-20">// Output console initialized...</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ref-box max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark mr-2"></i> 模擬與測試工具</h5>
                <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://rtbkit.org/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">RTBkit - Open Source RTB Framework</a></li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-link mr-2"></i><a href="https://bidder.dev/" target="_blank" class="hover:text-blue-600 underline">Bidder.dev - RTB Bidder Testing Environment</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <script>
        function showStep(n) {
            const target = document.getElementById('step-' + n);
            if (!target) return;
            document.querySelectorAll('.step-section').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            target.classList.add('active');
            
            document.querySelectorAll('.menu-item').forEach(m => m.classList.remove('active'));
            const allItems = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.menu-item'));
            const activeMenu = allItems.find(item => item.getAttribute('onclick') === `showStep(${n})`);
            if (activeMenu) activeMenu.classList.add('active');
            
            document.querySelector('.main-content').scrollTop = 0;
        }

        function runSim() {
            const btn = document.getElementById('sim-btn');
            const status = document.getElementById('sim-status');
            const view = document.getElementById('ad-view');
            const resBox = document.getElementById('sim-res');
            const qpsTag = document.getElementById('qps-tag');
            const latencyTag = document.getElementById('latency-tag');
            
            btn.disabled = true;
            status.innerText = "AUCTIONING... BROADCASTING BIDREQUEST TO 500+ ENDPOINTS";
            status.style.color = "#E31C22";
            resBox.innerHTML = "<div class='text-blue-400 animate-pulse'>[TCP_HANDSHAKE] Establishing connection...<br>[JSON_PARSE] Sending 1.2KB Payload...</div>";
            
            const start = Date.now();

            setTimeout(() => {
                const latency = Math.floor(Math.random() * 30) + 12;
                qpsTag.innerText = "Current QPS: 125,482";
                latencyTag.innerText = `Latency: ${latency}ms`;

                const res = { 
                    id: "rtb_sim_" + Date.now(), 
                    seatbid: [{ 
                        seat: "THE_TRADE_DESK",
                        bid: [{ 
                            price: 4.82, 
                            impid: "imp_1",
                            adm: `<div style='background:#1e293b; color:white; padding:40px; border-radius:20px; text-align:center; border:2px solid #E31C22; box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(227,28,34,0.4)'>
                                    <div style='font-size:10px; color:#E31C22; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:10px;'>OPENRTB SUCCESSFUL WIN</div>
                                    <h2 style='font-size:24px; font-weight:900;'>實戰：$4.82 CPM 得標</h2>
                                    <p style='font-size:12px; margin-top:15px; opacity:0.6'>ADM 物件已成功解碼並渲染</p>
                                    <div style='margin-top:20px; font-family:monospace; font-size:9px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:10px;'>Tracked: /win-notice?price=4.82</div>
                                  </div>` 
                        }] 
                    }] 
                };
                
                resBox.innerHTML = `<pre>${JSON.stringify(res, null, 2)}</pre>`;
                view.innerHTML = res.seatbid[0].bid[0].adm;
                status.innerText = "SUCCESS: 200 OK - AD RENDERED";
                status.style.color = "#10b981";
                btn.disabled = false;
            }, 800);
        }
    </script>
</body>
